  "instructions": [
    "In a shaker, muddle the simple syrup, maraschino liqueur, lemon twists, strawberry, and sugar cube.",
    "Add the tequilas and sherry and whip (shake with a few pieces of crushed ice, just until the ingredients are incorporated).",
    "Dump into a double rocks glass and top with crushed ice.",
    "Garnish with the half strawberry and serve with a straw."
  ],
